# Fire Trial - Elemental Battle Cutscene
# Features intense battle music, dramatic effects, and the Fire Elemental boss encounter

@backdrop textures/sewer-lava.gif [fadeIn=800]
@char HERO sprite=characters/male
@char FIRE_ELEMENTAL sprite=monsters/fire_elemental

@do playBgm [name=audio/brass-loop.mp3]

wait 800

# The Fire Elemental awakens

*FIRE_ELEMENTAL: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
WHO DARES ENTER MY DOMAIN?!
The flames of destruction hunger for souls!
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=worried,position=left]
"""
I am the chosen hero!
I've come to claim the Fire Shard!
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/dungeon-beat.mp3]

wait 500

FIRE_ELEMENTAL: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Fool! Countless warriors have tried.
Their ashes feed my eternal flames!
"""

@action HERO moveTo [x=30,duration=400]

wait 400

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=smile]
"""
I'm not like the others!
My determination burns brighter than any fire!
"""

wait 800

@transition wipe [duration=400]

wait 500

@backdrop textures/cave.gif [fadeIn=600]
@do playBgm [name=audio/deep-unknown-beat.mp3]

# Battle sequence

FIRE_ELEMENTAL: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Then BURN, mortal!
Feel the wrath of a thousand suns!
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/organ.mp3]

wait 600

HERO: [expression=tired,position=left]
"""
The heat... it's overwhelming...
But I cannot... give up now!
"""

wait 800

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=worried]
"""
Think, think...
Fire needs air to burn.
If I can cut off its source...!
"""

wait 600

@transition fadeOutBackdrop [duration=500]

wait 600

@backdrop textures/sewer-lava.gif [fadeIn=500]
@do playBgm [name=audio/calm-escape.mp3]

# Victory

FIRE_ELEMENTAL: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Impossible... my flames... extinguished...
You have... bested me...
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
I did it! The first trial is complete!
"""

*FIRE_ELEMENTAL: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
Take the Fire Shard, warrior.
You have proven your inner flame burns true.
Three more trials await you...
"""

wait 800

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
Thank you for the battle, Fire Guardian.
I'll carry this lesson forward.
"""

wait 600

@do playBgm [name=audio/dawns-peak.mp3]

@transition wipe [duration=700]

waitInput

@end
